msgctxt "92"
msgid "They canceled construction of Kamurocho Hills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Wha⑬!? How come!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I heard there was an incident of some sort at the construction site. The "
"whole construction company just up and left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "What a waste! They already had so much of it finished!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Canceling a job of that magnitude must've put a lot of people out of "
"work⑬and we're talking years of work. It's a real shame..."
msgstr ""

